  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A projectile is launched with an initial velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> at an angle <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta\"></span> above the horizontal. The projectile lands at the same height from which it was released. Air resistance is negligible.</p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p><br/>What is the time of flight of the projectile?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v sin \\theta}{g}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2v sin \\theta}{g}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2v cos \\theta}{g}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2v sin \\theta cos \\theta}{g}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
